  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Saleor is a headless, GraphQL-first open-source commerce platform. OSS self-host is free for production; Saleor Cloud Forever Free is non-commercial prototyping only — do not treat it as a merchant production free plan. Production Cloud (first-party 2026-08-18): Select $1599/mo (up to $200k GMV/mo, 0.8% overage), Volume $3999/mo (up to $1M GMV, 0.4% overage), Enterprise contact. Landscape open-source peer — WooCommerce keeps the cluster award (8.1). Research grounded 2026-08-18 from saleor.io/pricing.",
